The forests between [[Geography/Althane/Athrea/Thyropae/index|Thyropae]] and [[Geography/Althane/Athrea/Ialassa|Ialassa]]. The underbrush here grows extremely thick, making travel difficult for near everyone -- excepting, of course, the local inhabitants.
